## Protocol conformance

Revision {{ v('mcp.revision') }}; {{ v('mcp.tools') }} tools, {{ v('mcp.output_schemas') }} with an
output schema; conformance {{ v('mcp.conformance') }} over {{ v('mcp.transports') }}; an unsupported
